 "remarks": "South Norwalk has become one of Fairfield County's most sought-after waterfront neighborhoods -walkable to the train station, restaurants, shops, and the harbor. Tucked into this gated community at 15 Madison Street is Unit I6, a three-bedroom, one-bath multi-level townhouse with a well maintained kitchen featuring white cabinetry and stainless steel appliances, and a recently updated bathroom with a tiled tub surround. Laminate flooring runs throughout the home. Step outside to a private patio finished with new turf and updated fencing -low-maintenance outdoor space ready to enjoy! The unfinished basement offers potential for additional living space or a future half or full bath. One assigned parking space is included. Income, rental, and pet restrictions apply.",
